<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Jadaun</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Jadon Rajputs</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Jadaun are a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rajputs">Rajput</a> clan of northern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/india">India</a> who claim descent from the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yadava">Yadavas</a>, the lineage of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/krishna">Krishna</a>. In the early <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/middle-ages">medieval period</a> they ruled the region of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bayana">Bayana</a> in eastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rajasthan">Rajasthan</a>, and a branch later founded the state of Karauli, which its Jadaun <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maharaja">Maharajas</a> ruled until 1949.</p></div>
